      "content": "i know people say it gets better but it doesnt feel like that. it just feels like everything is pointless. max was the only thing that actually made me feel like i belonged somewhere. now that he's gone, it's like the world is just this huge, empty, meaningless void. i'm just tired of pretending that any of this matters.",
